<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-11-14T19:23:12.772Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 19:23:12 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Canada and the Philippines concluded talks on a free trade deal, signalling deeper economic ties. Australia and the Philippines signed a defence agreement as both nations respond to heightened South China Sea tensions. Chinese authorities deployed unauthorized buoys that the Philippines says create maritime hazards, while Chinese vessels continue patrols near contested features. The Philippine Coast Guard removed oil from a sunken landing craft tank off Surigao del Sur and 10ID and partners held an intelligence workshop to boost cooperation, and 176 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/14/canada-and-the-philippines-conclude-talks-on-free-trade-deal-mark-carney-says&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxQTkFzV2FpWkdORnNJVjQtcWVtRk1EX3FsaUVBMXFjRWdhRmVTazNjV05JUW1KbEd6U3Bva0RsY0VOVFB4M05qRzZab09DbThzTi13NnBMVERwR0VrZEVpUFd1aTR3cXFxX1o5dVFiQ3RJSHRPcnhyTEJyZ1d0VmRqR3ZTZFVVYzVyMVRIRmR3SEpLYUF0Q25YdUpocERYRmE4VFRiSnRkUHY?oc=5&quot;&gt;Manila Bulletin&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Inquirer.net&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxPMk1LTVZkQ2c2bWo3OGNyZ0VDMGY4RE13aXg4ckhreFpMLTU5bVdiWmx3cmNrX2dTR2Z5MHlxZEw1S1pQeWsxNFNjMVhueEI3emgwbzJmMVUtTkt1bERud0NrcEdYb1R5a01aM0ZZam9BNUlTZFljUS12a2pvTGljNmhCRWhFMHBNX2R3cnlhMGJkc1Y0WTZCVTI3SkFrcWM0VWxsYQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News &amp;amp; Headlines – Australian Broadcasting Corporation&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;SunStar Publishing Inc.&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Esquiremag.ph&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;NST Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rs